	"descriptionMarkdown": "A design for a first, 450 tons freight carrier for the inner planets. No quality, plenty of energy to stay in orbit of Fulgora. It absolutely needs blue belts to work, and a good amonth of space platforms to be constructed. I recommend having physical damage researched at level 6 minimum.\nIt has 18 cargo bays, speed controlled pumps for fuel (at 250 km/s, so it mean in practice a speed between 245 and 255) and 180 base speed if it runs indefinitely. The collectors are filtered individually to balance their storage and use them for asteroid storage in addition of the main sushi belt. It stores 1k ammo in its cargo bay in addition of the sushi belt, and it considers it's good to go when it reach at least 500 ammo,  and 15k fuel.\n\nIt can look a bit overkill for a first ship, but I promise you, you will carry a lot of stuff around the solar system with it, and it will be still relevant long in your game. The vast amount of storage makes it fit to either do a regular line between two planets or a loop allaround the four inner planets.",
